NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/tools.AssertBriefSurface kind=func
  digest=b3:94e48d3f1fda3dc1dc55551cf4e75681175f44975db7e6f18686ff02572e4608 file=neo/internal/tools/brief.go range=61:81 lang=go exported=true byte_range=1999:2921
  sig=func AssertBriefSurface(schemas []llm.Tool) error
  doc=AssertBriefSurface returns an error naming the first tool in a schema set that\nis NOT an allowed brief tool (read-only info tool or memory_recall). The brief\nstructural guarantee (req 15.1/18.1) depends on this returning nil for the\nadvertised surface a brief agent hands the model. read_overflow is exempt: it\nis a synthetic read-the-rest-of-a-truncated-result tool, not an information or\nvalue-moving tool.
EDGES
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/tools/brief.go

