  sig=type DelegateFunc func(ctx context.Context, proseIntent string) (string, error)
  doc=DelegateFunc runs a prose intent through the MCL pipeline and returns its\nverifiable outcome. Injected by the agent wiring (see internal/delegate);\nnil until wired, in which case core_execute reports it is unavailable.
