NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/tools.Manager.dispatchPersonalizationSave kind=method
  digest=b3:4eb2d82016745db5fb9ab17511d6ed188affd6116c8d31b9814be213291562bb file=neo/internal/tools/personalization.go range=103:133 lang=go exported=false byte_range=4572:5996
  sig=func (m *Manager) dispatchPersonalizationSave(ctx context.Context, args map[string]interface{}) (string, bool, error)
  doc=dispatchPersonalizationSave enforces the confirmation gate (req 12.3) and\npersists the confirmed profile through the wired writer. Refusals are\nreturned in-band (isError=true, err=nil) so the model reads the steer —\npresent the summary, get the explicit confirmation — rather than the harness\nretrying a doomed call.
